==Battleground==
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*9 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

